# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pauli propagation {#pauli-propagation}"
msgstr "Perambatan Pauli {#pauli-propagation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `pauli-prop` package provides a Rust-accelerated Python interface for performing Pauli propagation.\n"
msgstr "Pakej `pauli-prop` menyediakan antara muka Python dipercepat Rust untuk melakukan perambatan Pauli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pauli propagation is a framework for approximating the evolution of operators in the Pauli basis under the action of other operators, such as quantum circuit gates and noise channels. This approach can be effective when the operators involved are expected to remain sparse in the Pauli basis.\n"
msgstr "Perambatan Pauli ialah rangka kerja untuk menganggarkan evolusi pengendali dalam asas Pauli di bawah tindakan pengendali lain, seperti gate litar kuantum dan saluran hingar. Pendekatan ini boleh berkesan apabila pengendali yang terlibat dijangka kekal jarang dalam asas Pauli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The subroutines in this package may be used to implement error mitigation techniques such as [lightcone shading](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc) [\\[6\\]](#references) and [propagated noise absorption](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna) [\\[7\\]](#references), [operator backpropagation](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp) [\\[8\\]](#references) for circuit depth reduction, and classical simulation of expectation values [\\[1-5\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Subrutin dalam pakej ini boleh digunakan untuk melaksanakan teknik pengurangan ralat seperti [lightcone shading](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc) [\\[6\\]](#references) dan [propagated noise absorption](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna) [\\[7\\]](#references), [operator backpropagation](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp) [\\[8\\]](#references) untuk pengurangan kedalaman litar, dan simulasi klasik nilai jangkaan [\\[1-5\\]](#references).\n"

