# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for noisy simulations \\[[guide](/addons/pauli-prop/guides/simulate-noisy-expectation-values)]\n"
msgstr "Sokongan untuk simulasi berhingar \\[[panduan](/addons/pauli-prop/guides/simulate-noisy-expectation-values)]\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ability to truncate terms during evolution based on an absolute coefficient tolerance, a fixed number of terms in the evolving operator, or a combination of both\n"
msgstr "Keupayaan untuk memangkas sebutan semasa evolusi berdasarkan toleransi pekali mutlak, bilangan sebutan tetap dalam pengendali yang berevolusi, atau gabungan kedua-duanya\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ability to perform Pauli propagation in both the Schrödinger and Heisenberg frameworks\n"
msgstr "Keupayaan untuk melakukan perambatan Pauli dalam kedua-dua rangka kerja Schrödinger dan Heisenberg\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Novel technique for approximating the conjugation of a Pauli-sum operator by another Pauli operator. This heuristic implementation greedily generates contributions to the product expected to be most significant. See Appendix B of [\\[7\\]](#references) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Teknik baharu untuk menganggarkan konjugasi pengendali hasil tambah Pauli oleh pengendali Pauli yang lain. Pelaksanaan heuristik ini secara tamak menjana sumbangan kepada hasil darab yang dijangka paling ketara. Lihat Appendix B [\\[7\\]](#references) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Single-threaded\n"
msgstr "Satu-bebenang\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Computational requirements {#computational-requirements}"
msgstr "Keperluan pengiraan {#computational-requirements}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Both the memory and time cost for Pauli propagation routines generally scale with the size to which the evolved operator is allowed to grow.\n"
msgstr "Kos memori dan masa bagi rutin perambatan Pauli secara amnya meningkat mengikut saiz yang dibenarkan untuk pengendali yang berevolusi berkembang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`propagate_through_rotation_gates()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/pauli-prop/propagation#pauli_prop.propagation.propagate_through_rotation_gates \"pauli_prop.propagation.propagate_through_rotation_gates\"): As the Pauli operator is propagated in the Pauli basis under the action of a sequence of $N$ Pauli rotation gates of an $M$-qubit circuit, the number of terms will grow as $\\mathcal{O}(2^N)$ towards a maximum of $4^M$ unique Pauli components. To control memory usage, the operator is truncated after application of each gate, which introduces some error proportional to the magnitudes of the truncated terms’ coefficients. The memory requirements are linear in the size of the evolved operator, and runtime scales linearly in both the operator size and the number of gates.\n"
msgstr "[`propagate_through_rotation_gates()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/pauli-prop/propagation#pauli_prop.propagation.propagate_through_rotation_gates \"pauli_prop.propagation.propagate_through_rotation_gates\"): Apabila pengendali Pauli dirambatkan dalam asas Pauli di bawah tindakan jujukan $N$ gate putaran Pauli bagi litar $M$-qubit, bilangan sebutan akan bertambah sebagai $\\mathcal{O}(2^N)$ menuju maksimum $4^M$ komponen Pauli yang unik. Untuk mengawal penggunaan memori, pengendali dipangkas selepas setiap gate dikenakan, yang memperkenalkan sedikit ralat berkadar dengan magnitud pekali sebutan yang dipangkas. Keperluan memori adalah linear terhadap saiz pengendali yang berevolusi, dan masa jalan meningkat secara linear dengan saiz pengendali dan bilangan gate.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`propagate_through_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/pauli-prop/propagation#pauli_prop.propagation.propagate_through_operator \"pauli_prop.propagation.propagate_through_operator\"): Conjugates one operator in the Pauli basis by another by greedily accumulating terms in the sum, $\\sum_{i,j,k}G^{\\dagger}_iO_jG_k$, where $i,j,k$ are sparse indices over the Pauli basis. This implementation sorts the coefficients in each operator by descending magnitude then searches the 3D index space for the terms with the largest coefficients, starting with the origin $(0,0,0)$, and accumulating $(i,j,k)$ triplets up to a specified cutoff. The time spent searching can often be made negligible by increasing the search step size in $(i,j,k)$ space, which provides a cubic speedup for this subroutine. In our profiling, significant time can be spent sorting the operators and performing Pauli multiplication to generate the terms in the new operator.\n"
msgstr "[`propagate_through_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/pauli-prop/propagation#pauli_prop.propagation.propagate_through_operator \"pauli_prop.propagation.propagate_through_operator\"): Mengkonjugasikan satu pengendali dalam asas Pauli dengan pengendali lain dengan mengumpul sebutan secara tamak dalam hasil tambah, $\\sum_{i,j,k}G^{\\dagger}_iO_jG_k$, dengan $i,j,k$ ialah indeks jarang atas asas Pauli. Pelaksanaan ini menyusun pekali dalam setiap pengendali mengikut magnitud menurun kemudian mencari ruang indeks 3D untuk sebutan dengan pekali terbesar, bermula dengan asalan $(0,0,0)$, dan mengumpul triplet $(i,j,k)$ sehingga had yang ditentukan. Masa yang dihabiskan untuk mencari selalunya boleh dijadikan boleh diabaikan dengan meningkatkan saiz langkah carian dalam ruang $(i,j,k)$, yang memberikan pecutan kubik untuk subrutin ini. Dalam pemprofilan kami, masa yang ketara boleh dihabiskan untuk menyusun pengendali dan melakukan pendaraban Pauli bagi menjana sebutan dalam pengendali baharu.\n"

